  "description": "Oh Seung-ji seeks out Room 201 of the Palace of Versailles in search of the mother who abandoned him. It turns out to be not a palace, but a shabby, run-down boarding house, and instead of his mother, he's occupied by Louis, rumored to be the \"fourth-generation successor to the Bourbon Group.\" And so, the story unfolds, a gritty survival game of their daily struggle to make ends meet.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=810561), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9793504)",
